OL,3,GNEWSA'Jury still out' on Bibury traffic
OL,4,Ameasures
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns have been raised that measures
OL,7,Faimed at easing traffic problems in a
OL,8,Ftourist village are not working.
OL,10,FBibury, home to the picturesque
OL,11,FArlington Row cottages, has struggled
OL,12,Fwith traffic for years. Gloucestershire
OL,13,FCounty Council introduced a trial coach
OL,14,Fdrop-off point last year to ease
OL,15,Fcongestion, but some say coaches are
OL,16,Fnot always using it.
OL,18,FCraig Chapman, chair of Bibury Parish
OL,19,FCouncil, said "the jury is still
OL,20,Fsubstantially out" on whether it is
OL,21,Fworking.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
