OL,3,GNEWSA'Jury still out' on Bibury traffic
OL,4,Ameasures
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe county council's cabinet member for
OL,7,Fsustainable transport and road safety,
OL,8,FRoger Whyborn, said it was
OL,9,F"disappointing" to see reports that
OL,10,Fsome were not using the bays as
OL,11,Fintended.
